---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Tabletop"
	description="Astro base site with a React SPA mounted at /tabletop and Cloudflare-ready SSR routes."
>
	<section class="mx-auto flex min-h-[100svh] max-w-6xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16">
		<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr] lg:items-end">
			<div class="space-y-8">
				<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-cyan-300">
					Astro + React Router + Cloudflare
				</p>
				<div class="space-y-4">
					<h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-white sm:text-6xl">
						Sitio estático base con una SPA capturada bajo <span class="text-cyan-300">/tabletop</span>.
					</h1>
					<p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
						La home sigue siendo estática. La SPA vive en un único shell Astro y React Router resuelve
						las deep links en cliente. Cloudflare queda listo para convivir con rutas SSR puntuales.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
					<a
						class="rounded-full bg-cyan-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-cyan-200"
						href="/tabletop"
					>
						Abrir la SPA
					</a>
					<a
						class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-cyan-300 hover:text-cyan-200"
						href="/pricing"
					>
						Ver ruta SSR
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-950/40 backdrop-blur">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-slate-400">Estado actual</p>
				<ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-200">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
						<span>React integrado como renderer oficial de Astro.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
						<span>Tailwind 4 activado vía plugin Vite.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
						<span>Cloudflare Workers preparado para mezcla static + SSR.</span>
					</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
						<span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
						<span>Fallback de `/tabletop/*` al mismo HTML mediante `_redirects`.</span>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
